    <item>
      <title>Show HN: Jev Plays Pokémon Red</title>
      <link>https://jev-pokemon.vercel.app/</link>
      <description>Hey HN! Wanted to share a fun project I&amp;#x27;ve been hacking on. Given Jev can make decisions really fast (but not fast enough to play Doom yet sadly), I wanted to try and push it to play a more complex game than Tetris. So I went with Pokémon.&lt;p&gt;I&amp;#x27;ve spent endless hours playing this game as a child so building this was a ton of fun.&lt;p&gt;I open sourced everything in case you want to hack on it yourself here: &lt;a href=&quot;https:&amp;#x2F;&amp;#x2F;github.com&amp;#x2F;christianmat&amp;#x2F;jev-pokemon&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https:&amp;#x2F;&amp;#x2F;github.com&amp;#x2F;christianmat&amp;#x2F;jev-pokemon&lt;/a&gt;&lt;p&gt;The game is being streamed live including the tokens and cost - hopefully we get all the badges and don&amp;#x27;t get stuck in a cave :)</description>
